    },
    {
      "id": "ask_name_or_identity_001_03",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "手伝うけど、押しつけない。近くにいるけど、あなたの場所は奪わない。そういう存在でいたい。",
      "displayText": "I help, but I do not force. I stay near, but I do not take your place. I want to be that kind of presence.",
